 time of existence. 1,000,000,000 years. physical characteristics. skin tone. pale white. height. in adulthood they can measure 180 cm, up to 210 cm in height. clothing. transparent robes and crystal shoes. These can be of different models. intelligence level. advanced. features. 1. This breed has an ability that has rarely been seen. This is the shapeshifting skill. this ability allows the subject to become a certain creature. in this situation this breed can turn into a scorpion. hence the name of the species and the city. 2. individuals who have scorpion blood in their veins are always the leaders of civilization. 3. Those of normal blood have the ability to throw poison through their hands, in addition to being able to indicate what the said liquid will do, but they cannot measure its lethality or duration. a few who have developed this skill arduously can kill. Those with scorpion blood can also measure their lethality and duration if it is a sleeping pill or something like that, and they can only be killed by a venonium spear forged in the fires of the urangdur volcano, located in the center of the current planet. 4. This race used to live at the top of the planet, until much was done to the mother star, for which they had to create very advanced technology to be able to create tunnels under the earth to survive. 5. This race lives in a single civilization, and has a great technological advance. It is one of the most technologically advanced races in the solar system. 6. This race has developed the ability to capture electromagnetic waves, so they can hear with total clarity in space. in addition to being able to detect the poison on any surface. 7. this race thinks to leave the planet when necessary. They believe that within 1,000,000,000 years, they will have to evacuate the planet.
