historia del planeta. el planeta se creo luego de que una estrella colisionara con el sol. la estrella se fue expandiendo, y absorbio con su campo magnetico a unos cuantos meteoros, creando la superficie del planeta, y la estrella se volvio en su nucleo. la atmosfera del planeta se creo apartir del campo magnetico de la misma, junto a los gases que fueron liverados por los meteoros y la estrella. debido a que choco con el sol, quedo muy cerca de el, pero la diosa de fuego ayudo para que pueda ser habitable para algun tipo de vida. Estos son, los scorpionarus. el mundo estaba lleno de vegetacion a pesar de su cercania al sol, hasta que un dia el sol se calento mas de lo normal terminando con la vegetacion del planeta. Para este momento, las especies que vivian en ese lugar, fueron trasladadas bajo tierra. donde los scorpionarus havian hecho una base militar para la guerra contra los queloro, que en ese momento acababan de vencer a los scorpionarus luego de una cruel batalla. Todas las especies de plantas y animales fueron trasladadas a los tuneles subterranots, y poco a poco la ciudad pudo prosperar. los distintos pueblos de scorpionarus se reunieron en un mismo lugar. Todos tenian una deidad en comun, que era la diosa Flayerne, y con ayuda de ella, pudieron rehacer su civilizacion. Y llegamos al hoy. actualmente la ciudad scorpion recibe su nombre por Atreus scorpion, un piromante que fue derrotado en la gran guerra mientras protegia al resto de soldados que ivan a la ciudad mas cercana para avisar del ataque. el solo se enfrento a cerca de mil soldados queloros, todos armados. logro derrotar a la mayoria, y cuando bajo la guardia, un francotirador que habia sobrevivido a la batalla, le disparo en la cabeza, acabando con su vida. gracias a el, sse salvaron los que luego serian los fundadores de la ciudad junto a un grupo de sangre de escorpion. Hay una estatua suya en el templo llama eterna y en el templo roca sagrada, donde se entrenan a los piromantes y a los terramantes. Se espera que la ciudad permanezca en paz hasta que la temperatura del sol aumente, o que el planeta se hacerque mas al sol. solo unos cuantos metros podrian causar una extincion masiva en unos dias, por lo cual las capsulas y naves siempre estan preparadas para ese momento.=history of the planet. the planet was created after a star collided with the sun. The star expanded, absorbing a few meteors with its magnetic field, creating the surface of the planet, and the star became its core. the planet's atmosphere was created from its magnetic field, together with the gases that were liverated by the meteors and the star. Because it collided with the sun, it was very close to it, but the fire goddess helped so that it can be habitable for some kind of life. These are, the scorpionarus. the world was full of vegetation despite its proximity to the sun, until one day the sun became hotter than normal, killing the planet's vegetation. By this time, the species that lived in that place were moved underground. where the scorpionarus had made a military base for the war against the queloro, who at that time had just defeated the scorpionarus after a cruel battle. All species of plants and animals were transferred to the underground tunnels, and little by little the city was able to prosper. the different peoples of scorpionarus met in one place. They all had a deity in common, which was the goddess Flayerne, and with her help, they were able to rebuild their civilization. And we come to today. Currently the city scorpion receives its name from Atreus scorpion, a pyromancer who was defeated in the great war while protecting the rest of the soldiers who went to the nearest city to warn of the attack. he alone faced about a thousand complaining soldiers, all armed. he managed to defeat most of them, and when he lowered his guard, a sniper who had survived the battle shot him in the head, killing him. Thanks to him, those who would later become the founders of the city were saved along with a group of scorpion blood. There is a statue of him in the Eternal Flame Temple and in the Sacred Rock Temple, where pyromancers and earth lovers are trained. The city is expected to remain peaceful until the sun's temperature rises, or the planet gets warmer in the sun. just a few meters could cause a mass extinction in a few days, so capsules and ships are always ready for that moment.
